### POST access token
POST  https://accounts.spotify.com/api/token
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials

### POST access token for playback

### GET my profile
GET {{base-url}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### GET search results
GET {{base-url}}/search?q=monster%20florence&type=track
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Get another access token for playback

GET http://localhost:5000/auth/token

### Update servers token

GET http://localhost:5000/auth/login

### Transfer playback to a device

PUT {{base-url}}/me/player
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "device_ids": ["{{device-id}}"],
  "play": true
}


